role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Schrödinger's egg.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/af/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg..png/revision/latest?cb=20230512103517\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Schrödinger&#39;s egg.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/af/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230512103517\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/af/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230512103517 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/af/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg..png/revision/latest?cb=20230512103517 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Schrödinger&#39;s egg.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg..png\" data-image-name=\"Schrödinger&#39;s egg..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_15\" title=\"Series 15\">15</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kiell_Smith-Bynoe\" title=\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\">Kiell Smith-Bynoe</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/It%27s_my_milk_now.\" title=\"It&#39;s my milk now.\">It's my milk now.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/100%25_Bosco.\" title=\"100% Bosco.\">100% Bosco.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Schrödinger's egg.</b></i> is the seventh episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_15\" title=\"Series 15\">Series 15</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 11 May 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Kiell_Smith-Bynoe\" title=\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\">Kiell Smith-Bynoe</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Frankie_Boyle\" title=\"Frankie Boyle\">Frankie Boyle</a> asked the question \"So it's just a kind of blind Schrödinger's egg?\", during the <a href=\"/wiki/Rotate_the_pulper_wheel_without_pulping_the_egg\" title=\"Rotate the pulper wheel without pulping the egg\">Rotate the pulper wheel without pulping the egg</a> task. The title card for the episode is of the number 157 spelled in jelly babies, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Completely_free_yourselves_and_have_a_team_hug\" title=\"Completely free yourselves and have a team hug\">Completely free yourselves and have a team hug</a> task. The number 157 references Series 15, Episode 7.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Shrödingers æg', which translates as 'Schrödinger's egg'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Schrödingerin muna', which translates as 'Schrödinger's egg'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Frankie_Boyle\" title=\"Frankie Boyle\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Frankie Boyle</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ivo_Graham\" title=\"Ivo Graham\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ivo Graham</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jenny_Eclair\" title=\"Jenny Eclair\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jenny Eclair</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Kiell_Smith-Bynoe\" title=\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Kiell Smith-Bynoe</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mae_Martin\" title=\"Mae Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mae Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_brilliant_thing_that_pops_up\" title=\"Most brilliant thing that pops up\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most brilliant thing that pops up.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Rotate_the_pulper_wheel_without_pulping_the_egg\" title=\"Rotate the pulper wheel without pulping the egg\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Rotate the pulper wheel without pulping the egg. You must not move from this spot at any point. If you pulp the egg, you are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Completely_free_yourselves_and_have_a_team_hug\" title=\"Completely free yourselves and have a team hug\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Completely free yourselves and have a team hug.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_%22adjective%22_%22demonym_of_country%22_%22noun%22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Make a &quot;adjective&quot; &quot;demonym of country&quot; &quot;noun&quot;\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Write down a number between 0 and 100, a length of time between 1 minute and 20 minutes, five ingredients, a country, a noun and an adjective.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Make a [adjective] [country adjectival] [noun]. You must use all these ingredients and you must also clap [number] times.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Say_the_word_given_to_you_by_the_Taskmaster_in_the_accent_on_the_card_you_choose\" title=\"Say the word given to you by the Taskmaster in the accent on the card you choose\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Say the word given to you by the Taskmaster in the accent on the card you choose. The Taskmaster will guess what accent you are doing.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">20\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/schrödinger’s-egg\"><i>Schrödinger's egg.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-dema